Package: calibraqca
Title: Fuzzy Calibration Engine for Likert Data in fsQCA
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Javier", "Núñez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "jnverbel@gmail.com")
Description: Pure functions to validate, aggregate, calibrate and diagnose
    five-point Likert scales bound for an fsQCA analysis. It reimplements no
    statistical computation: it wraps QCA, SetMethods, psych, multilevel,
    lavaan and NCA. Exported function names and messages are in Spanish, as
    is the Shiny interface this engine backs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4)
Imports:
    NCA,
    QCA,
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    lavaan,
    multilevel,
    psych,
    readr,
    readxl,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
